---
kind: lore
id: north.dojo
title: The Verdant Dojo
---

// The Verdant Dojo (place.verdantDojo): Master Hollis and his top student
// Koji. Hollis gives the northDojo quest; the report objective is judged on
// talk@npc.verdantDojoMaster (quests/north/side.lute).

<beat id="enter" on="enterPlace" target="place.verdantDojo" title="The Verdant Dojo" priority="10">
  ::bg{location="verdant-dojo" time="day"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Paper walls, polished floors, and the sound of someone hitting a wooden post very hard. A banner over the mats reads: STRENGTH IS A HABIT.
</beat>

<entry id="northDojoAgain" on="enterPlace" target="place.verdantDojo" category="bark">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The wooden post in the corner has a new dent in it.
</entry>

<beat id="hollisAsk" on="talk" target="npc.verdantDojoMaster" title="The challenge" priority="20" when="quest.northDojo.state == 'unset'">
  ::auto{character="verdantDojoMaster" anchor="center" action="enter"}
  @verdantDojoMaster{code="0010" emotion="determined"}: A traveller with badges. Good. My students are getting lazy beating each other.
  @verdantDojoMaster{code="0020"}: Koji is my best. Beat him on the mats and come back to me. I will make it worth your while.
  ::accept{quest="northDojo"}
</beat>

<entry id="northHollisWaiting" on="talk" target="npc.verdantDojoMaster" category="bark" priority="10" when="quest.northDojo.state == 'active' && !holds('defeated', ['verdantDojoKarateKoji'])">
  @verdantDojoMaster{code="0010"}: Koji is waiting on the mats. He has been stretching for an hour. It is very annoying.
</entry>

<entry id="northHollisBark" on="talk" target="npc.verdantDojoMaster" category="bark">
  @verdantDojoMaster{code="0010" emotion="laughing"}: Strength is a habit! So is napping. I have both.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="verdantDojoKarateKoji" who="verdantDojoKarateKoji" intro="Hup! The master sent you? Then no holding back. Hyaaah!" win="I... have much to learn." lose="Again! Again tomorrow!" prize="3200" instance="use-001"/>

<entry id="northKojiAfter" on="talk" target="npc.verdantDojoKarateKoji" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['verdantDojoKarateKoji'])">
  @verdantDojoKarateKoji{code="0010"}: I lost to a traveller. The master will make me hit the post a thousand times. Worth it.
</entry>
